Network Scout migration provenance
==================================

This repository was established from code owned by the same GitHub account and
copied with the repository owner's explicit authorization on 2026-10-10.

Source snapshots:

- https://github.com/usmc1371nerd/omarchy-cyber-scout-widget
  - migrated into `backend/observer` and `integrations/omarchy`
  - supplied discovery, inventory, diagnostics, monitoring, dashboard, packaging,
    and Omarchy integration code
- https://github.com/usmc1371nerd/network-lab
  - migrated into `frontend` and `simulation/backend`
  - supplied the React canvas and isolated educational simulator

Neither source repository declared a GitHub-detectable license at migration
time. The MIT License in this repository applies to the unified repository as
authorized by its owner; this notice preserves source attribution and does not
retroactively alter the historical repositories.
